Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,MENDAKI is introducing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the Ready for School
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.62,0:00:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,e-voucher initiative
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,which we hope to help kids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,from Primary One
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.14,0:00:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,all the way up to university.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So, as we begin the school year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,as you know, for many parents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.12,0:00:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it's also a time where
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,there are a lot of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.46,0:00:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,expenses for school
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.32,0:00:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and we want our kids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,to have the best start in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.98,0:00:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You have things like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,schoolbooks, textbooks, uniforms
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and other expenses
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.22,0:00:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that parents have to fork out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And during these times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,especially when you have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,cost of living concerns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.74,0:00:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,challenging times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,we want to help parents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,from low-income families
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,to support their kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This year, MENDAKI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,is giving out $250 e-vouchers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.64,0:00:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,that parents can use
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.26,0:00:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,for their children
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,whether it's schoolbooks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.08,0:00:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,whether it is stationery
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,or even shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We are pegging it at about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,$1,000 per capita income
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So we expect more than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,22,000 students
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,who could benefit from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.86,0:00:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's an application basis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and we start to take
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.56,0:00:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,applications from 1st December.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So we hope that this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,will do its part
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.60,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to help parents and children
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,have a good start for the year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and not to worry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,about some of these expenses
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,that would have otherwise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,held them back.
